      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still happening, build 1552\n\nrepro:\n\n1) be in a world, load all people's avatars\n\n2) go to your homeworld\n\n3) start preloading some other world\n\n4) go back to the world from 1)\n\navatars will be stuck in \"Loading Cache\" state until preload finishes\n\nvideo example:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/aLEBH4k5G6E",
