  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Preloading a large world on a slow internet connection causes avatars fail to load from cache and get stuck on the 'loading cache' phase of loading the avatar.\n\nCancelling the preload solves this and avatars load normally until preload is started again.",
